 Lining...\",\"overview\":\"Miami Metro continues their hunt for The Brain Surgeon, while Dr. Vogel enlists Dexter's help. Debra continues to track down her PI case and has to take matters into her own hands.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zSXKPVeW1mZ1rhBE6OG2ICXXnvo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"voteCount\":77,\"airDate\":\"2013-07-07\",\"runtime\":57},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"What's Eating Dexter Morgan?\",\"overview\":\"Dexter continues his search for The Brain Surgeon. Dr. Vogel tries to prove to Dexter that he's perfect. Debra's guilt begins to creep up\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Ar1RTbPvDSdDUc33V49QX5lcRxo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"voteCount\":74,\"airDate\":\"2013-07-14\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Scar Tissue\",\"overview\":\"Dexter tracks down another potential serial killer from Dr. Vogel’s list. Quinn celebrates his passing of the Sergeant’s exam by defending Debra’s honor in a fight. Dr. Vogel begins treating Debra for her PTSD.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vUhpyOERYLVC49P450zmDeGWMtx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":76,\"airDate\":\"2013-07-21\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"This Little Piggy\",\"overview\":\"Dr. Vogel comes into contact with The Brain Surgeon, so Dexter and Debra come together to try and keep her safe.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mBB7UV5Qb9ZD76RZLYXEMavmVBP.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"voteCount\":75,\"airDate\":\"2013-07-28\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"A Little Reflection\",\"overview\":\"Dexter monitors a young psychopath to see if he is suited for his table. Dexter and Debra finally get back to normal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jhcF6qbj3qJNnAqZ6J5URGkI4TW.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":80,\"airDate\":\"2013-08-04\",\"runtime\":55},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Dress Code\",\"overview\":\"Dexter and Debra’s newly healed relationship is threatened. Dex adjusts to being a mentor.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5q68Iy9MB0l1osSi404MePZ1xEx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":75,\"airDate\":\"2013-08-11\",\"runtime\":53},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Are We There Yet?\",\"overview\":\"Dexter tracks down his protégé in the belief that he murdered an innocent person. Meanwhile, Dexter tries to help Hannah escape the country.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zzJy8KWJqQPhjMA3uG2h8SbjO81.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"voteCount\":77,\"airDate\":\"2013-08-18\",\"runtime\":52},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Make Your Own Kind of Music\",\"overview\":\"Dexter investigates a murder that hits close to home. Meanwhile, Dr. Vogel gets the surprise of her life when someone from her past returns.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9yRjrK62A8nyzJCNICt19k4LKXL.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"voteCount\":73,\"airDate\":\"2013-08-25\",\"runtime\":55},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Goodbye Miami\",\"overview\":\"With Dr. Vogel's help, Dexter tries to lure The Brain Surgeon to a location in order to get him on the table. In the meanwhile, Dexter witnesses a murder.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7rtNUEydPUGyoUu4AM2hpJW3S5W.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"voteCount\":77,\"airDate\":\"2013-09-08\",\"runtime\":53},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Monkey in a Box\",\"overview\":\"Dexter is torn between fleeing the country with Hannah and Harrison or taking Saxon out for good.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3MefgmO0eYWlXUFSic7Dn45UUur.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":82,\"airDate\":\"2013-09-15\",\"runtime\":52},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Remember the Monsters?\",\"overview\":\"As a deadly hurricane closes in, Dexter must make a life-altering decision to protect those he loves.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eej5sOpA2A73O6SudZxFsw2oB5n.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"voteCount\":117,\"airDate\":\"2013-09-22\",\"runtime\":56}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2006-10-01\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}